                        "review": "*STEAM DECK USERS DO NOT CHANGE THE RENDER LEAVE IT TO OPENGL*\nI really liked this game more than the second game but unfortunately I made the grave mistake of changing the render from openGL to Direct3D cause I was curious which broke my entire game then when I fixed it for a bit and wanted to change it I put software since I didn't see openGL and there my game was completely broken it wouldn't start no more and I tired fixing it again but to no avail then I made the genius mistake of deleting the RedOrchestra.ini file hoping it would make a new one but it hasn't come back and I already spent 5 hours trying to fix this game and I have given up hope.\n\nEdit: fixed it now but still beware",
